('applied-linux-a01-l1', 6, 1, 'Files and application configuration', 'mint', 'Inspect, change, and verify an application setting.', 'Inspect the configuration', '8 min', 'Configuration is a source of desired settings; the runbook is a separate expectation. The simulated editor shows save and quit controls before editing is required.', 'A fictional API in /opt/training-api is configured for port 8080 while its runbook requests 8081. Locate both sources and establish the mismatch before editing.', '[{"id":"a01-1-task-1","title":"Find the application directory and configuration.","description":"Find the application directory and configuration.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ls capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ls — find the application directory and configuration.."],"feedback":"Config and runbook paths are identified.","expectedOutcome":"Config and runbook paths are identified."},{"id":"a01-1-task-2","title":"Read the configured port and runbook endpoint.","description":"Read the configured port and runbook endpoint.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the cd capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: cd — read the configured port and runbook endpoint.."],"feedback":"Both values are supported by file evidence.","expectedOutcome":"Both values are supported by file evidence."},{"id":"a01-1-task-3","title":"Record the observed mismatch with both file paths.","description":"Record the observed mismatch with both file 