('applied-linux-a01-l2', 6, 2, 'Files and application configuration', 'mint', 'Inspect, change, and verify an application setting.', 'Make a controlled configuration change', '8 min', 'Configuration is a source of desired settings; the runbook is a separate expectation. The simulated editor shows save and quit controls before editing is required.', 'A maintenance window authorizes changing only the training app port to 8081. Back up the original file, use the simulated editor, then validate syntax and value.', '[{"id":"a01-2-task-1","title":"Create a backup and compare its contents with the original.","description":"Create a backup and compare its contents with the original.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ls capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ls — create a backup and compare its contents with the original.."],"feedback":"Backup preserves original content.","expectedOutcome":"Backup preserves original content."},{"id":"a01-2-task-2","title":"Edit only the permitted port setting.","description":"Edit only the permitted port setting.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the cd capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: cd — edit only the permitted port setting.."],"feedback":"Only the authorized value changed.","expectedOutcome":"Only the authorized value changed."},{"id":"a01-2-task-3","title":"Validate JSON syntax and confirm port 8081.","description":"Validate JSON syntax and confirm port 8081.","hint":"First ident