('applied-linux-a01-l3', 6, 3, 'Files and application configuration', 'mint', 'Inspect, change, and verify an application setting.', 'Verify the application', '8 min', 'Configuration is a source of desired settings; the runbook is a separate expectation. The simulated editor shows save and quit controls before editing is required.', 'The config now specifies 8081. Reload only the authorized lab service, test the endpoint, inspect fresh logs, and explain what the check proves.', '[{"id":"a01-3-task-1","title":"Reload the fictional service and inspect its status.","description":"Reload the fictional service and inspect its status.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ls capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ls — reload the fictional service and inspect its status.."],"feedback":"Reload is reflected in service state/logs.","expectedOutcome":"Reload is reflected in service state/logs."},{"id":"a01-3-task-2","title":"Request the configured health endpoint.","description":"Request the configured health endpoint.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the cd capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: cd — request the configured health endpoint.."],"feedback":"Port 8081 responds healthy.","expectedOutcome":"Port 8081 responds healthy."},{"id":"a01-3-task-3","title":"Hand over the change and cite endpoint and log evidence.","description":"Hand over the change and cite endpoint and log evidence.","hint":"First identify the resource, ti