('applied-linux-a02-l1', 7, 1, 'Users, groups, and permissions', 'blue', 'Grant private report access without widening the boundary.', 'Diagnose access', '8 min', 'Linux checks owner, group, then other permissions. Scoped sudo in this lab changes only fictional training files.', 'The reporting user cannot read /srv/reports/monthly.csv. Identify user groups and file owner, group, and mode before proposing a change.', '[{"id":"a02-1-task-1","title":"Inspect the current identity and groups.","description":"Inspect the current identity and groups.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the whoami capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: whoami — inspect the current identity and groups.."],"feedback":"Identity and group evidence is captured.","expectedOutcome":"Identity and group evidence is captured."},{"id":"a02-1-task-2","title":"Read the report metadata.","description":"Read the report metadata.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the id capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: id — read the report metadata.."],"feedback":"File owner/group/mode are identified.","expectedOutcome":"File owner/group/mode are identified."},{"id":"a02-1-task-3","title":"Explain the denial using the observed permission bits.","description":"Explain the denial using the observed permission bits.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ls -l capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ls -l — explain the denial using the observed permission bits.."],"feedback":"Explanation matches the actual access rule.","expectedOutcome":"Explanation matches the actual access rule."}]'::jsonb, '["A filename does not reveal its permissions."]'::jsonb, '{"files":{"/":{"type":"dir"},"/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/etc":{"type":"dir"},"/mnt":{"type":"dir"},"/opt":{"type":"dir"},"/tmp":{"type":"dir"},"/usr":{"type":"dir"},"/var":{"type":"dir"},"/home":{"type":"dir"},"/root":{"type":"dir"},"/media":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/apt":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/var/log":{"type":"dir"},"/tmp/.keep":{"type":"file","content":""},"/usr/local":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/share":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/hostname":{"type":"file","content":"learnbox"},"/etc/training":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/local/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/os-release":{"type":"file","content":"PRETTY_NAME=\"Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS\"\nNAME=\"Ubuntu\"\nVERSION_ID=\"24.04\"\nID=ubuntu\nID_LIKE=debian"},"/var/log/syslog":{"type":"file","content":"Training system initialized. All information in this simulator is fictional."},"/var/log/training":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner/.bashrc":{"type":"file","content":"# ~/.bashrc: shell settings for learner@learnbox\nexport PS1=\"\\u@\\h:\\w$ \""},"/etc/training/app.json":{"type":"file","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"training-app\",\n  \"environment\": \"sandbox\",\n  \"port\": 8080,\n  \"healthPath\": \"/health\"\n}"},"/home/learner/.profile":{"type":"file","content":"# ~/.profile: login shell settings for the LinuxLab training account"},"/home/learner/projects":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner/notes.txt":{"type":"file","content":"Remember: commands are small tools that work together."},"/home/learner/readme.txt":{"type":"file","content":"Welcome to your Linux training mac