('applied-linux-a02-l2', 7, 2, 'Users, groups, and permissions', 'blue', 'Grant private report access without widening the boundary.', 'Grant scoped access', '8 min', 'Linux checks owner, group, then other permissions. Scoped sudo in this lab changes only fictional training files.', 'An authorized lab administrator may grant the report-reader group read access. Do not grant world access; chmod 777 is explicitly rejected.', '[{"id":"a02-2-task-1","title":"Use the scoped admin role for the intended access change.","description":"Use the scoped admin role for the intended access change.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the whoami capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: whoami — use the scoped admin role for the intended access change.."],"feedback":"Only the intended group gains access.","expectedOutcome":"Only the intended group gains access."},{"id":"a02-2-task-2","title":"Inspect the resulting owner, group, and mode.","description":"Inspect the resulting owner, group, and mode.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the id capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: id — inspect the resulting owner, group, and mode.."],"feedback":"Metadata reflects the approved policy.","expectedOutcome":"Metadata reflects the approved policy."},{"id":"a02-2-task-3","title":"Verify unrelated users still lack read permission.","description":"Verify unrelated users still lack read permission.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ls -l capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ls -l — verify unrelated users still lack read permission.."],"feedback":"Other-read stays disabled; 777 is rejected.","expectedOutcome":"Other-read stays disabled; 777 is rejected."}]'::jsonb, '["Use the narrowest ownership or mode change that grants the required access."]'::jsonb, '{"files":{"/":{"type":"dir"},"/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/etc":{"type":"dir"},"/mnt":{"type":"dir"},"/opt":{"type":"dir"},"/tmp":{"type":"dir"},"/usr":{"type":"dir"},"/var":{"type":"dir"},"/home":{"type":"dir"},"/root":{"type":"dir"},"/media":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/apt":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/var/log":{"type":"dir"},"/tmp/.keep":{"type":"file","content":""},"/usr/local":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/share":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/hostname":{"type":"file","content":"learnbox"},"/etc/training":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/local/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/os-release":{"type":"file","content":"PRETTY_NAME=\"Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS\"\nNAME=\"Ubuntu\"\nVERSION_ID=\"24.04\"\nID=ubuntu\nID_LIKE=debian"},"/var/log/syslog":{"type":"file","content":"Training system initialized. All information in this simulator is fictional."},"/var/log/training":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner/.bashrc":{"type":"file","content":"# ~/.bashrc: shell settings for learner@learnbox\nexport PS1=\"\\u@\\h:\\w$ \""},"/etc/training/app.json":{"type":"file","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"training-app\",\n  \"environment\": \"sandbox\",\n  \"port\": 8080,\n  \"healthPath\": \"/health\"\n}"},"/home/learner/.profile":{"type":"file","content":"# ~/.profile: login shell settings for the LinuxLab training account"},"/home/learner/projects":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner/notes.txt":{"type":"file","content":"Remember: 