('applied-linux-a02-l3', 7, 3, 'Users, groups, and permissions', 'blue', 'Grant private report access without widening the boundary.', 'Verify the boundary', '8 min', 'Linux checks owner, group, then other permissions. Scoped sudo in this lab changes only fictional training files.', 'Verify that report-reader can read the report while guest-audit cannot, then report both outcomes.', '[{"id":"a02-3-task-1","title":"Test access as report-reader.","description":"Test access as report-reader.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the whoami capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: whoami — test access as report-reader.."],"feedback":"Intended read succeeds.","expectedOutcome":"Intended read succeeds."},{"id":"a02-3-task-2","title":"Test access as unrelated guest-audit.","description":"Test access as unrelated guest-audit.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the id capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: id — test access as unrelated guest-audit.."],"feedback":"Unrelated read is denied.","expectedOutcome":"Unrelated read is denied."},{"id":"a02-3-task-3","title":"Submit both results and the remaining boundary.","description":"Submit both results and the remaining boundary.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ls -l capability