('applied-linux-a03-l2', 8, 2, 'Remote server access', 'purple', 'Connect to the intended fictional host and keep host state separate.', 'Inspect the remote environment', '8 min', 'The prompt identifies the active host. SSH sessions and their filesystem changes are simulated and isolated per training host.', 'Collect app version and port evidence from lab-app-01, not the local workstation. Local and remote filesystems may contain similarly named paths.', '[{"id":"a03-2-task-1","title":"Confirm hostname, user, and current directory.","description":"Confirm hostname, user, and current directory.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ssh capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ssh — confirm hostname, user, and current directory.."],"feedback":"Remote identity is proven.","expectedOutcome":"Remote identity is proven."},{"id":"a03-2-task-2","title":"Locate and read remote application configuration.","description":"Locate and read remote application configuration.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the hostname capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: hostname — locate and read remote application configuration.."],"feedback":"Configuration is read in remote context.","expectedOutcome":"Configuration is read in remote context."},{"id":"a03-2-task-3","title":"Record the remote host as the evidence source.","description":"Record the remote host as the evidence source.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable