('applied-linux-a03-l3', 8, 3, 'Remote server access', 'purple', 'Connect to the intended fictional host and keep host state separate.', 'Disconnect and reconnect', '8 min', 'The prompt identifies the active host. SSH sessions and their filesystem changes are simulated and isolated per training host.', 'A remote-only scratch note was created. Exit, confirm the local host and isolation, reconnect, then verify that the note persists remotely.', '[{"id":"a03-3-task-1","title":"Exit and confirm the local prompt returns.","description":"Exit and confirm the local prompt returns.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ssh capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ssh — exit and confirm the local prompt returns.."],"feedback":"Local session is restored.","expectedOutcome":"Local session is restored."},{"id":"a03-3-task-2","title":"Verify local host and absence of the remote-only note.","description":"Verify local host and absence of the remote-only note.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the hostname capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: hostname — verify local host and absence of the remote-only note.."],"feedback":"Local and remote filesystems remain distinct.","expectedOutcome":"Local and remote filesystems remain distinct."},{"id":"a03-3-task-3","title":"Reconnect and read the persisted remote note.","description":"Reconnect and read the persisted remote note.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable 