('applied-linux-a04-l1', 9, 1, 'Networking, DNS, ports, and HTTPS', 'orange', 'Separate name resolution, routing, listening ports, and HTTP/TLS evidence.', 'Check the destination', '8 min', 'DNS maps names to addresses; routes select next hops; sockets show listeners; HTTPS adds certificate and hostname checks. These checks are separate.', 'A client cannot reach api.training.test. Its DNS answer differs from the destination in the approved client record. Identify the mismatch from supplied evidence.', '[{"id":"a04-1-task-1","title":"Inspect the hostname and its resolved training address.","description":"Inspect the hostname and its resolved training address.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ip addr capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ip addr — inspect the hostname and its resolved training address.."],"feedback":"Hostname and resolver answer are captured.","expectedOutcome":"Hostname and resolver answer are captured."},{"id":"a04-1-task-2","title":"Inspect local route and client destination record.","description":"Inspect local route and client destination record.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ip route capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ip route — inspect local route and client destination record.."],"feedback":"Route and configured destination are compared.","expectedOutcome":"Route and configured destination are compared."},{"id":"a04-1-task-3","title":"Report the conflicting destination with evidence.","description":"Report the conflicting destination with evidence.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the getent hosts capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: getent hosts — report the conflicting destination with evidence.."],"feedback":"Mismatch is stated without claiming a route change.","expectedOutcome":"Mismatch is stated without claiming a route change."}]'::jsonb, '["Changing URL text does not create a valid network route."]'::jsonb, '{"files":{"/":{"type":"dir"},"/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/etc":{"type":"dir"},"/mnt":{"type":"dir"},"/opt":{"type":"dir"},"/tmp":{"type":"dir"},"/usr":{"type":"dir"},"/var":{"type":"dir"},"/home":{"type":"dir"},"/root":{"type":"dir"},"/media":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/apt":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/var/log":{"type":"dir"},"/tmp/.keep":{"type":"file","content":""},"/usr/local":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/share":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/hostname":{"type":"file","content":"learnbox"},"/etc/training":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/local/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/os-release":{"type":"file","content":"PRETTY_NAME=\"Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS\"\nNAME=\"Ubuntu\"\nVERSION_ID=\"24.04\"\nID=ubuntu\nID_LIKE=debian"},"/var/log/syslog":{"type":"file","content":"Training system initialized. All information in this simulator is fictional."},"/var/log/training":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner/.bashrc":{"type":"file","content":"# ~/.bashrc: shell settings for learner@learnbox\nexport PS1=\"\\u@\\h:\\w$ \""},"/etc/training/app.json":{"type":"file","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"training-app\",\n  \"environment\": \"sandbox\",\n  \"port\": 8080,\n  \"healthPath\": \"/health\"\n}"},"/home/learner/.profile":{"type":"file","content":"# ~/.profile: login shell settings f