('applied-linux-a04-l3', 9, 3, 'Networking, DNS, ports, and HTTPS', 'orange', 'Separate name resolution, routing, listening ports, and HTTP/TLS evidence.', 'Investigate HTTPS or allowlisting', '8 min', 'DNS maps names to addresses; routes select next hops; sockets show listeners; HTTPS adds certificate and hostname checks. These checks are separate.', 'A WAF-style event shows a source address mismatch behind a proxy. Inspect certificate and forwarded-IP evidence; proxy handling is explicitly unconfirmed.', '[{"id":"a04-3-task-1","title":"Inspect certificate hostname, validity, and TLS termination evidence.","description":"Inspect certificate hostname, validity, and TLS termination evidence.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ip addr capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ip addr — inspect certificate hostname, validity, and tls termination evidence.."],"feedback":"Certificate evidence is recorded.","expectedOutcome":"Certificate evidence is recorded."},{"id":"a04-3-task-2","title":"Read the WAF event’s source and forwarded-IP fields.","description":"Read the WAF event’s source and forwarded-IP fields.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ip route capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ip route — read the waf event’s source and forwarded-ip fields.."],"feedback":"Proxy source and configured forwarding are compared.","expectedOutcome":"Proxy source and configured forwarding are compared."},{"id":"a04-3-task-3","title":"Report supported cause and what needs confirmation.","description":"Report supported cause and what needs confirmation.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the getent hosts capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: getent hosts — report supported cause and what needs confirmation.."],"feedback":"Report does not assume which client IP the allowlist sees.","expectedOutcome":"Report does not assume which client IP the allowlist sees."}]'::jsonb, '["An allowlist source can depend on proxy and forwarded-IP configuration."]'::jsonb, '{"files":{"/":{"type":"dir"},"/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/etc":{"type":"dir"},"/mnt":{"type":"dir"},"/opt":{"type":"dir"},"/tmp":{"type":"dir"},"/usr":{"type":"dir"},"/var":{"type":"dir"},"/home":{"type":"dir"},"/root":{"type":"dir"},"/media":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/apt":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/var/log":{"type":"dir"},"/tmp/.keep":{"type":"file","content":""},"/usr/local":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/share":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/hostname":{"type":"file","content":"learnbox"},"/etc/training":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner":{"type":"dir"},"/usr/local/bin":{"type":"dir"},"/etc/os-release":{"type":"file","content":"PRETTY_NAME=\"Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS\"\nNAME=\"Ubuntu\"\nVERSION_ID=\"24.04\"\nID=ubuntu\nID_LIKE=debian"},"/var/log/syslog":{"type":"file","content":"Training system initialized. All information in this simulator is fictional."},"/var/log/training":{"type":"dir"},"/home/learner/.bashrc":{"type":"file","content":"# ~/.bashrc: shell settings for learner@learnbox\nexport PS1=\"\\u@\\h:\\w$ \""},"/etc/training/app.json":{"type":"file","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"training-app\",\n  \"environment\": \"sandbox\",\n  \"port\": 8080,\n  \"healthPath\": \"/health\"\n}"},"/hom