('applied-linux-a05-l1', 10, 1, 'Processes, services, and logs', 'pink', 'Diagnose and recover a fictional unavailable website.', 'Inspect system and service status', '8 min', 'A process is a running program; a service manager controls configured units; journal and application logs have different sources.', 'The training website is unavailable. Begin read-only: inspect app service, processes, and resource readings to identify the affected component.', '[{"id":"a05-1-task-1","title":"Check service state and process snapshot.","description":"Check service state and process snapshot.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the ps capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: ps — check service state and process snapshot.."],"feedback":"Service and process observations are recorded.","expectedOutcome":"Service and process observations are recorded."},{"id":"a05-1-task-2","title":"Inspect relevant resource readings.","description":"Inspect relevant resource readings.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the top capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: top — inspect relevant resource readings.."],"feedback":"Readings are tied to the supplied host/time.","expectedOutcome":"Readings are tied to the supplied host/time."},{"id":"a05-1-task-3","title":"Select the component supported by the evidence.","description":"Select the component supported by the evidence.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would d