('applied-linux-a07-l3', 12, 3, 'Backups and file transfers', 'blue', 'Archive, transfer, and restore evidence without overwriting unrelated data.', 'Restore and verify', '8 min', 'Archives package files; a transfer copies bytes to a host; checksums compare content. Each operation changes simulated filesystem state.', 'Restore into a separate recovery directory. Compare recovered files with expected originals without overwriting unrelated files.', '[{"id":"a07-3-task-1","title":"Create or select an isolated recovery directory.","description":"Create or select an isolated recovery directory.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the tar capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: tar — create or select an isolated recovery directory.."],"feedback":"Recovery path is separate.","expectedOutcome":"Recovery path is separate."},{"id":"a07-3-task-2","title":"Extract the archive into that directory.","description":"Extract the archive into that directory.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the scp capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: scp — extract the archive into that directory.."],"feedback":"All required files were extracted.","expectedOutcome":"All required files were extracted."},{"id":"a07-3-task-3","title":"Compare restored contents with expected originals.","description":"Compare restored contents with expected originals.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possi