('applied-linux-a08-l1', 13, 1, 'Shell scripts and scheduling', 'purple', 'Build a reporting script and advance a simulated scheduler.', 'Build a reporting script', '8 min', 'The shell supports a documented Bash subset only. This scheduler advances with a fictional clock and never runs on the application host.', 'The on-call team needs a daily report with host, disk, memory, and service state. Build the script with the documented Bash subset.', '[{"id":"a08-1-task-1","title":"Create a script with the required report fields.","description":"Create a script with the required report fields.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the Bash subset capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: Bash subset — create a script with the required report fields.."],"feedback":"Script includes all required fields.","expectedOutcome":"Script includes all required fields."},{"id":"a08-1-task-2","title":"Use quoting and redirection safely.","description":"Use quoting and redirection safely.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the variables capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: variables — use quoting and redirection safely.."],"feedback":"Paths and quoted values are correct.","expectedOutcome":"Paths and quoted values are correct."},{"id":"a08-1-task-3","title":"Inspect the generated script contents.","description":"Inspect the generated script contents.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish