('applied-linux-a08-l2', 13, 2, 'Shell scripts and scheduling', 'purple', 'Build a reporting script and advance a simulated scheduler.', 'Run and troubleshoot the script', '8 min', 'The shell supports a documented Bash subset only. This scheduler advances with a fictional clock and never runs on the application host.', 'The supplied script has a path or execute-permission problem. Diagnose it, correct only the issue, and inspect report output.', '[{"id":"a08-2-task-1","title":"Inspect script path and mode.","description":"Inspect script path and mode.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the Bash subset capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: Bash subset — inspect script path and mode.."],"feedback":"Failure cause matches observed state.","expectedOutcome":"Failure cause matches observed state."},{"id":"a08-2-task-2","title":"Correct the supplied path or permission fault.","description":"Correct the supplied path or permission fault.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the variables capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: variables — correct the supplied path or permission fault.."],"feedback":"Only needed permission/path is changed.","expectedOutcome":"Only needed permission/path is changed."},{"id":"a08-2-task-3","title":"Run the script and verify the report values.","description":"Run the script and verify the report values.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish th