('applied-linux-a08-l3', 13, 3, 'Shell scripts and scheduling', 'purple', 'Build a reporting script and advance a simulated scheduler.', 'Schedule and verify', '8 min', 'The shell supports a documented Bash subset only. This scheduler advances with a fictional clock and never runs on the application host.', 'Add the specified schedule with its timezone, then advance the training clock to verify a generated report.', '[{"id":"a08-3-task-1","title":"Create the lab schedule at the supplied time and timezone.","description":"Create the lab schedule at the supplied time and timezone.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the Bash subset capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: Bash subset — create the lab schedule at the supplied time and timezone.."],"feedback":"Schedule fields are correct.","expectedOutcome":"Schedule fields are correct."},{"id":"a08-3-task-2","title":"Advance the simulated clock past its next run.","description":"Advance the simulated clock past its next run.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the variables capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: variables — advance the simulated clock past its next run.."],"feedback":"Run occurs only after clock advance.","expectedOutcome":"Run occurs only after clock advance."},{"id":"a08-3-task-3","title":"Inspect the scheduler record and generated report.","description":"Inspect the scheduler record and generated report.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and 