('applied-linux-a09-l1', 14, 1, 'Docker containers and DDEV projects', 'orange', 'Inspect container state and resolve an alternate project address.', 'Inspect containers', '8 min', 'DDEV manages a local development project and Docker manages containers. Neither is interchangeable with systemctl.', 'A fictional containerized API is failing. Identify its image, status, restart count, and relevant log evidence.', '[{"id":"a09-1-task-1","title":"List the running and stopped containers.","description":"List the running and stopped containers.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the docker ps capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: docker ps — list the running and stopped containers.."],"feedback":"Container selection is exact.","expectedOutcome":"Container selection is exact."},{"id":"a09-1-task-2","title":"Inspect the target container and image identity.","description":"Inspect the target container and image identity.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the docker images capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: docker images — inspect the target container and image identity.."],"feedback":"Current container metadata is observed.","expectedOutcome":"Current container metadata is observed."},{"id":"a09-1-task-3","title":"Read logs and identify the supplied failure clue.","description":"Read logs and identify the supplied failure clue.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish t