('applied-linux-a10-l3', 15, 3, 'Printers and print queues', 'pink', 'Configure a virtual queue and preserve unrelated jobs.', 'Investigate a stuck job', '8 min', 'Printer discovery, queue changes, and job output are virtual. Nothing is sent to a physical printer.', 'One training job is stuck while another is unrelated. Cancel or correct only the affected job, then verify its lifecycle.', '[{"id":"a10-3-task-1","title":"Inspect queue and identify the stuck job.","description":"Inspect queue and identify the stuck job.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the lpinfo capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: lpinfo — inspect queue and identify the stuck job.."],"feedback":"Affected job is distinguished by ID.","expectedOutcome":"Affected job is distinguished by ID."},{"id":"a10-3-task-2","title":"Cancel the affected job or apply the permitted correction.","description":"Cancel the affected job or apply the permitted correction.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the lpadmin capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: lpadmin — cancel the affected job or apply the permitted correction.."],"feedback":"Only intended job changes.","expectedOutcome":"Only intended job changes."},{"id":"a10-3-task-3","title":"Submit a replacement if required and verify unrelated job remains intact.","description":"Submit a replacement if required and verify unrelated job remains intact.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evid