('sre-operations-b02-l2', 17, 2, 'Alarms, escalation, and incident reporting', 'blue', 'Evaluate alarm state and create evidence-backed handovers.', 'Correlate alarms and service impact', '8 min', 'This lab uses CloudWatch-like alarm evaluation and separately labeled training status. Squadcast-style routing is fictional context, not a confirmed integration.', 'A composite rule and repeated notifications refer to a single service issue. Keep cloud alarm states separate from fictional Normal/Cautious/Serious labels.', '[{"id":"b02-2-task-1","title":"Inspect composite rule and service evidence.","description":"Inspect composite rule and service evidence.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the alarm evaluator capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: alarm evaluator — inspect composite rule and service evidence.."],"feedback":"Alarm, notification, and incident are separated.","expectedOutcome":"Alarm, notification, and incident are separated."},{"id":"b02-2-task-2","title":"Group repeated notifications that refer to the same incident.","description":"Group repeated notifications that refer to the same incident.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the notification timeline capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: notification timeline — group repeated notifications that refer to the same incident.."],"feedback":"Duplicate notices are not counted as separate incidents.","expectedOutcome":"Duplicate notices are not counted as separat