('sre-operations-b04-l3', 19, 3, 'Vulnerability findings and security events', 'orange', 'Separate raw security evidence from interpretation and confidence.', 'Investigate suspicious sign-ins', '8 min', 'Security findings and event rules are fictional training records. An empty findings view does not establish scan coverage.', 'Group supplied events by user/source/endpoint and compare later success with authorized support records. Similar-looking events may be unrelated.', '[{"id":"b04-3-task-1","title":"Filter the supplied time window.","description":"Filter the supplied time window.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the findings dashboard capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: findings dashboard — filter the supplied time window.."],"feedback":"Time filter is correct.","expectedOutcome":"Time filter is correct."},{"id":"b04-3-task-2","title":"Group failures and inspect later successful logins.","description":"Group failures and inspect later successful logins.","hint":"First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","hints":["First identify the resource, time scope, and observable evidence that would distinguish the possible causes.","Use the event viewer capability introduced for this lesson to inspect or change the training state.","For this task, start with: event viewer — group failures and inspect later successful logins.."],"feedback":"Events are grouped with source context.","expectedOutcome":"Events are grouped with source context."},{"id":"b04-3-task-3","title":"Submit confidence, evidence, and next action without unsupported compromise claims.","description":"Submit confidence, evidence, and next action without unsuppor